      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/QCGov/status/2052644936324132995",
      "text": "Hanap niyo ba ay productive at insightful na activities ngayong bakasyon? Sign niyo na 'to para sumali! ⛅️📚💯\n\nSa pangunguna ng Quezon City Youth Development Office (QCYDO), handog namin ang mga programa na swak para mas ma-develop ang skills, talent, at confidence ng mga kabataang QCitizen this summer season. 🚀\n\n🌧️ Oplan Kontra Baha Sessions\nTara at sumali sa interactive outdoor activities sa ating komunidad para maging handa at ligtas sa darating na tag-ulan!\n\n✍️ Writing and Publishing Workshop\nKung nasa \"author era\" ka, ilabas mo na ang main character at supporting characters sa creative stories mo!\n\n🧳 Youth Entrepreneurship for Child in Conflict with the Law (CICL)\nNew opportunities at fresh beginnings ang naghihintay dito para sa mga CICL tungo sa mas maliwanag na kinabukasan.\n\nDon’t miss this chance to learn more, grow, and thrive in Quezon City! 💙❤️\n\nPara sa karagdagang impormasyon, maaaring makipag-ugnayan sa Quezon City Youth Development Office (QCYDO):\n\n📍 7th Floor, Civic Center Building A, Quezon City Hall Compound, Diliman, Quezon City\n📞 8988 4242 | Loc. 8707, 8738\n📧 qcydo@quezoncity.gov.ph\n🌐 https://t.co/RgBs6EaeoA\n\nTingnan ang iba pang summer activities na maaari ninyong salihan dito:\n\nQuezon City Public Library: https://t.co/90aicfPLeD\n\nQC Tourism Department: https://t.co/j13f9UmoqQ\n\nQuezon City Sports Development Office: https://t.co/VVMBIFNdwC\n\nAll aboard Expo 2026: https://t.co/Lfz65TWTpj\n\nQuezon City Fire District: https://t.co/fPG1Rl8PmG\n\nRosario Maclang Bautista General Hospital (RMBGH): https://t.co/M27vH5ZWtk\n\nQuezon City Disaster Risk Reduction and Management Office: https://t.co/CpiAIbKHcJ\n\nOffice of the City Administrator and Amoranto Sports Complex: https://t.co/UmCvsvnY4f\n\nTraffic and Transport Management Department: https://t.co/8BjPQ9luVi\n\nDepartment of Public Order and Safety: https://t.co/cN5e0pT5qW\n\n#QCSummerActivities2026",
